Adelaide has no Mecca[ Max]ima stores, so I had to order the Urban Decay Gwen[ Stef]ani Eyeshadow Palette from Mecca online. While this has been available for a while in the US, it was only released on[ Boxing] Day here.
I'm IN LOVE with this palette. I feel like it was made for me. I know a lot of people have said there's not much in the way of colour selection, but for someone pale it's the perfect palette.
