> [Normally], in an everyday car kind of way, so long as it[�]�s shiny, a nice colour and isn[�]�t going to break down, usually I[�]�m fairly easy going. Jules (who takes care of our brides and[ gro]oms) on the other hand has been very focussed on cars this last week and definitely knows what she likes. She[�]�s also got an uncanny knack of remembering every number plate that she comes across. It[�]�s that attention to detail that is mind boggling!
