> If you are looking for one of the best high end luxury apartment rentals in all of London I highly recommend checking out the Cheval Residence’s Th[orney] Court Apartments. Located near[ Hyde] Park and Kensington Palace, the apartments are just a short tube ride from the Thames and from being right in downtown London.
